  "contentHtml": "<p>충북혁신도시 내 동성중학교에서 시간강사님을 모십니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>화요일, 목요일 1교시부터 4교시까지이며, 2학년 전담입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학습지도 등사 완료되어있어 강의만 해 주시면 됩니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>강사님 사정에 맞게 최대한 배려해 주신다고 합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>동성중학교 043-750-5000, 선생님 010-2672-6772</p><p>&#160;</p><p>많은 관심 부탁드립니다. 감사합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-map\" id=\"maps_1774255015135\" data-maps-data=\"addr=%EC%B6%A9%EB%B6%81%20%EC%9D%8C%EC%84%B1%EA%B5%B0%20%EB%A7%B9%EB%8F%99%EB%A9%B4%20%EB%8F%99%EC%84%B1%EB%A6%AC%20449&amp;addtype=1&amp;confirmid=23242904&amp;docid=&amp;idx=1&amp;ifrH=362px&amp;ifrW=490px&amp;mapHeight=362&amp;mapInfo=%7B%22version%22%3A2%2C%22mapWidth%22%3A490%2C%22mapHeight%22%3A362%2C%22mapCenterX%22%3A620985%2C%22mapCenterY%22%3A948458%2C%22mapLevel%22%3A4%2C%22coordinate%22%3A%22wcongnamul%22%2C%22markInfo%22%3A%5B%7B%22markerType%22%3A%22standPlace%22%2C%22coordinate%22%3A%22wcongnamul%22%2C%22x%22%3A620985%2C%22y%22%3A948461%2C%22clickable%22%3Atrue%2C%22draggable%22%3Atrue%2C%22icon%22%3A%7B%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A56%2C%22offsetX%22%3A17%2C%22offsetY%22%3A56%2C%22src%22%3A%22%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Flocalimg%2Flocalimages%2F07%2F2012%2Fattach%2Fpc_img%2Fico_marker2_150331.png%22%7D%2C%22content%22%3A%22%EB%8F%99%EC%84%B1%EC%A4%91%ED%95%99%EA%B5%90%22%2C%22confirmid%22%3A23242904%7D%5D%2C%22graphicInfo%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22roadviewInfo%22%3A%5B%5D%7D&amp;mapWidth=490&amp;mapX=620985&amp;mapY=948458&amp;map_hybrid=false&amp;map_level=4&amp;map_type=TYPE_MAP&amp;rcode=4377033000&amp;tel=043-750-5012&amp;title=%EB%8F%99%EC%84%B1%EC%A4%91%ED%95%99%EA%B5%90\" data-maps-thumbnail=\"https://ssl.daumcdn.net/map3/staticmap/image?center=620985%2C948458&amp;lv=4&amp;size=540x350&amp;srs=WCONGNAMUL&amp;markers=symbol%3Asc_marker%7Clocation%3A620985%2C948461\" style=\"width: 490px; height: 362px;\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"map\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-mce-style=\"width: 490px; height: 362px;\" data-mce-selected=\"1\"><div class=\"content_plusmap\" data-mapd